---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Kuroaxe handles enquiry details and site data."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <article class="shell max-w-3xl py-20 lg:py-28">
    <p class="kicker">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-6 text-5xl sm:text-6xl">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-bone">
      <p>
        Kuroaxe collects only what you choose to send through the enquiry form or by email: name, work email,
        company, optional phone, services of interest, budget, timeline, and project notes.
      </p>
      <p>
        We use that information to respond, to assess fit, and—if we work together—to run the engagement. We do
        not sell personal data. We do not add you to marketing lists unless you ask.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website may use essential cookies or local storage required for the site to function. Analytics, if
        introduced later, will be documented here.
      </p>
      <p>
        Placeholder policy for launch. Replace with counsel-reviewed terms before collecting live client data.
        Questions: <a class="link-gilt" href="mailto:studio@kuroaxe.com">studio@kuroaxe.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
